      "q": "What is a backlink?",
      "a": "<p>A backlink is a link from another website to yours. Search engines read good ones as a vote of trust.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "Are all backlinks good?",
      "a": "<p>No. Links from relevant, trusted sites help. Bought or spammy links can hurt you.</p>"
    },
